Provider: RxValet

The RxValet website will give you several options to obtain your medications. It will give you a list of local
options as well as Mail order. It will also give you access to Prescription Assistance Programs (PAP) that
will help you reduce the cost of your medications significantly. The application process is simple and quick.

Step 1

Access the RxValet member at https://www.myrxvalet.com

Step 2

Login/Register then click ‘Register Now.’

Step 3

Enter your Member ID and enter Member Code/Rx Group Number (GIH1000). Your Member
ID/Number will be in an email sent to you by Rx Valet on your ID card.

Step 4

Review your cards and make sure that your information is correct. ALWAYS present this card at the
pharmacy first.

Step 5

Make sure you bookmark MyRxValet.com so you can receive important emails from the company.

Step 6

If you need to contact the RxValet the number is (855) 798-2538

