Quest Labs

The Quest Diagnostic Advanced Lab Program is also called QuestSelect™. This program
allows you to obtain outpatient laboratory testing* at no cost to you. When your doctor orders lab testing,
you can show your QuestSelect® card and use your QuestSelect™ benefit. Tell the medical receptionist at
your doctor’s office and at the Quest Diagnostic lab that you are a QuestSelect member. The Quest
Diagnostics receptionist will want your member ID number available to on your Member ID card. This is
how Quest Diagnostics knows not to bill you for care.

If your doctor has given you a written lab order, call the Lab Line to schedule your visit.

If your doctor’s office is going to draw your blood in the office and doesn’t use Quest, ask them to call
the Quest Diagnostics™ Lab Line to pick up your test sample. (Questions/Lab Line number is:
1.800.646.7788)

​This is a subscription program and is NOT insurance. This subscription gives you outpatient laboratory
testing at no out-of-pocket cost to you* when you present your QuestSelect™ card and ask to use
QuestSelect®.

​

When you use QuestSelect™, you have a $0 Copay for over 1,200 different blood, urine, cytology,
pathology, and cultures that are included in the subscription.

The QuestSelect™ laboratory benefit does DOES NOT COVER:

​

Testing ordered during hospitalization.

Lab work that is needed on an emergency or (STAT) basis.

Testing completed at another laboratory.

Time-sensitive esoteric testing such as fertility testing, bone marrow studies and spinal fluid tests.

